    {
      "itemIdentifier": "ogch.registry.reportedPropertyColumns",
      "$schema": "metaschema.yaml",
      "name": "Reported-Property-Column Specification Registry",
      "abstract": "Registry of reusable schema:PropertyValueSpecification reported-property column definitions derived from technique TAPP workbooks. Each $def constrains one column of the reported-property table -- the variables a procedure REPORTS, as distinct from the analytes and channels it acquires. TAPP building blocks reference these definitions via fragment $refs so they resolve locally through the building-block register. The root only hosts $defs; it has no instantiable properties of its own. TAPP building blocks reference these definitions via fragment $refs so they resolve locally through the register.",
