      "$schema": "metaschema.yaml",
      "name": "Lock-In Thermography Technique-Aligned Procedure Profile (litTAPP)",
      "abstract": "Lock-In Thermography extension of the base TAPP definition. CORE-ONLY DRAFT: the native technique layer is empty. LIT has no ADA detail schema and no technique-specific property in any ADA record, so there was nothing to seed one from and none was invented. This registers the procedure skeleton and needs Phase 0 seed papers before it says anything LIT-specific. Generated from draftTAPPs/LIT_TAPP_draft_v2.csv by tools/build_tapp.py.",
