      "name": "Nanoindentation and Microindentation Technique-Aligned Procedure Profile (niMiTAPP)",
      "abstract": "Nanoindentation and Microindentation extension of the base TAPP definition. CORE-ONLY DRAFT: the native technique layer is empty. NI-MI has no ADA detail schema and no technique-specific property in any ADA record, so there was nothing to seed one from and none was invented. This registers the procedure skeleton and needs Phase 0 seed papers before it says anything NI-MI-specific. Generated from draftTAPPs/NI-MI_TAPP_draft_v2.csv by tools/build_tapp.py.",
