      "abstract": "Transmission electron microscopy (TEM/STEM, incl. EDS/EELS) extension of the base TAPP definition. Basic protocol-tier fields are required top-level ada: properties; Advanced protocol-tier fields are schema:additionalProperty[] entries; an ada:analyteTemplate carries per-element columns. Generated from docs/TEM_TAPP_v7.xlsx by tools/build_tapp.py.",
