      "$schema": "metaschema.yaml",
      "name": "VNMIR Technique-Aligned Procedure Profile (vnmirTAPP)",
      "abstract": "Visible, near- and mid-infrared reflectance/emissivity spectroscopy extension of the base TAPP definition. Basic procedure-tier fields are required top-level ada: properties; Advanced procedure-tier fields are schema:additionalProperty[] PropertyValueSpecification entries. VNMIR has no per-element analyte axis, so no ada:analyteTemplate is defined. DRAFT - generated from draftTAPPs/VNMIR_TAPP_draft_v2.csv by tools/build_tapp.py; the source table has not been through Phase 0 review.",
