      "abstract": "X-ray diffraction extension of the base TAPP definition. XRD reports phases rather than per-element concentrations, so no ada:analyteTemplate is defined; no mode-flag columns, since it delivers a single technique componentType. DRAFT - generated from draftTAPPs/XRD_TAPP_draft_v2.csv by tools/build_tapp.py; the source table has not been through Phase 0 review.",
